/target
.claude
# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/*.egg-info/
# uv: we use `uv venv` + `uv pip install` (pip-interface), not project-mode
# `uv sync`, so the lockfile / pinned version are local artifacts, not
# authoritative. Un-ignore + commit them if this ever adopts `uv sync`.
**/uv.lock
**/.python-version

# Build artifacts from `maturin develop`
**/*.so
**/*.pyd

# RL training outputs (models, vecnorm stats, tensorboard logs)
runs/
**/runs/
